---
title: TypeScript SDK
order: 8
---

The Compeer TypeScript SDK allows you to interact with Compeer from Javascript or TypeScript applications.

## Requirements

Find supported JavaScript runtimes and TypeScript versions in the [requirments](https://github.com/compeer-ai/typescript-sdk#requirements) section of the `typescript-sdk` repository `README.md`.

## Installation

Install the Compeer TypeScript SDK using npm:

```bash
npm install @compeer-ai/sdk
```

## API Reference

For detailed information on available methods and types, please refer to the [API Reference](https://github.com/compeer-ai/typescript-sdk/blob/main/api.md) in our `typescript-sdk` repository.

## Usage

You can find detailed usage examples the [usage](https://github.com/compeer-ai/typescript-sdk#usage) section of the `typescript-sdk` repository `README.md`.


